# DIAGNOSTICS

`CROI_ERR_BAD_HANDLE` as for any handle; see syscall(2).
`CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE`: the resource is not of kind IOPORT.
`CROI_ERR_OUT_OF_RANGE`: it does not grant the range.
`CROI_ERR_ACCESS_DENIED`: the range includes ports the kernel owns.
`CROI_ERR_NO_MEMORY`: no memory for the bitmap.

